### Create a new book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Programming",
  "description": "Learn Java from scratch",
  "tags": ["java", "programming", "backend"]
}

### Get all books (paginated, default page=0, size=20)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy

### Get all books (page 0, size 5)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy

### Get all books (page 1, size 5, sorted by name)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=5&sort=name,asc
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy

### Get book by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy

### Search books by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?name=Java
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy

### Update book
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Programming Updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "tags": ["java", "updated"]
}

### Delete book by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy

### Health check (public - no auth required)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### App info (public - no auth required)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### Metrics (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2Vy

### Swagger UI (open in browser)
# http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

### OpenAPI JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI YAML
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs.yaml
Accept: application/x-yaml
